# Accepted vulnerabilities in the reference app (Google Online Boutique)
#
# These are third-party dependencies in code we don't own. The upstream
# project tracks these. We scan them (for visibility) but do not block
# deployment on them since they're reference code, not our production app.
#
# Review date: 2026-04-06 (90 days)
# Owner: platform team

# protobufjs arbitrary code execution via injected type fields
# Affects: app/src/currencyservice, app/src/paymentservice
# Tracking: upgrade upstream dependency; not on our critical path
CVE-2026-41242

# anyio TLS certificate spoofing via IDN encoding
# Affects: app/src/shoppingassistantservice
# Tracking: upgrade upstream dependency
CVE-2026-63374
